---
config:
  gantt:
    useWidth: 800
    numberSectionStyles: 2
---
gantt
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    excludes weekends, 2014-01-15
    includes 2014-01-18
    todayMarker off
    section First<br>part
    Write    :a, 2014-01-06, 6d
    Review   :after a, 3d
    section Second
    Publish  :crit, done, 2014-01-16, 2014-01-21
    section Third
    Rest     :active, 2014-01-20, 2d
